| riscos-mesa EGL test: the window shown through a hardware overlay (VideoOverlay; egltest -V asks for one).
| Click in it: H overlay off/on, P pause. Results are also saved in this directory.
RMEnsure VideoOverlay 0.00 IfThere System:Modules.VideoOverlay Then RMLoad System:Modules.VideoOverlay
Dir <Obey$Dir>
| ELF programs need the slot set before they start, whatever the Next slot is
WimpSlot -min 16000K
Run egltest -w -V -o egloverlay
